\viewkind4\uc1\pard\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\f0\fs24\'b6 Verse 1\ulnone\b0 
\par 1   This night which we are recalling\cf0 
\par \pard\li144\sl190\slmult0  should be celebrated by nations
\par   Angels from heavens are so pleased
\par  that Jesus Christ is born today
\par 
\par \pard\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 2\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par  2.  God's own son, their Lord and master
\par \pard\li144\sl190\slmult0\qj  a little child came to this earth
\par \pard\li144\sl202\slmult0\qj\cf1  \cf0 they worshipped him and sang praises
\par  to uplift and glorify God
\par 
\par \pard\sl202\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 3\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par  3.  He showed compassion for all men
\par \pard\li144\sl202\slmult0\qj   and thereby brought peace to the world
\par   making them look more beautiful
\par   and showered his blessings on us
\par \pard\f1 
\par \cf1\ul\b\f2 
\par }

